Package: 1bit-archive-keyring
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 1bit <packages@1bit.gg>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: signing key for the 1bit apt repository
 The public half of the archive key that signs 1bit.gg/apt's
 Release file. Every 1bit OS box trusts the repository through
 this keyring and nothing else (apt's signed-by), so a package
 this key did not sign is not installable.
